  "type": "manhwa",
  "description": "Freedom is all our heroine wants, but that isn't what she finds when she is summoned across worlds into the body of Lady Beatrice and is newly named \"Regria.\" As a \"divine being\" who can purify the minds of \"divine knights,\" Regria is expected to wed the Belligram Empire's Prince Rahich, who only sees her as a tool that will keep him from going insane. But when Beatrice's original soul finds Regria in a moment of danger, she tells her how she can be free: by untangling Rahich's twisted soul and making him kneel at her feet. \n\n(Source: Tappytoon)",
